# Copy this file to:
#   `.env.local` — local dev (`npm run dev`)
#   `.env`         — Docker build/run (`docker compose build`)
# Both are gitignored. Never commit secrets or machine-specific URLs.
#
# Production (VM): create `.env` in the project folder — see docs/VM_DEPLOYMENT.md.

